---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Donate" description="Support the work of God's World, God's Way.">
  <h1>Support the Work</h1>

  <p>God's World, God's Way is a listener-supported ministry. Every contribution — large or small — directly funds teaching, production, and distribution. Thank you for standing with us.</p>

  <section class="giving-section">
    <h2>Give Through Commission Ministers Network</h2>
    <p>CMN (Commission Ministers Network) is a credentialed ministers network recognised as a 501(c)3 organisation. Donations processed through CMN are <strong>tax-deductible</strong> for US donors. Your gift goes directly to support this ministry.</p>
    <a
      class="donate-btn"
      href="https://cmnetwork.denarionline.com/Donate/?missionary=ConkNath"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Donate via CMN (Tax-Deductible)
    </a>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <section class="giving-section">
    <h2>Give Directly via PayPal</h2>
    <p>You can also support the work with a direct PayPal contribution. Direct gifts are <strong>not tax-deductible</strong> but reach the ministry immediately and without processing overhead.</p>

    <div class="paypal-container">
      <script src="https://www.paypal.com/sdk/js?client-id=BAAoZJ3SV3bVWi1yozsZIx_cy2W16V1oD37vuFQl9xTAVF7mgr1xNXA8HqfTGtTEHfV20cfmwmpMJxlCk8&components=hosted-buttons&disable-funding=venmo&currency=GBP"></script>
      <div id="paypal-container-R36A95QRG7QB8"></div>
      <script>
        paypal.HostedButtons({
          hostedButtonId: "R36A95QRG7QB8",
        }).render("#paypal-container-R36A95QRG7QB8")
      </script>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .giving-section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .giving-section p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .donate-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .donate-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  hr {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .paypal-container {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
